---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
List the rule catalog the diff classifies differences with

Usage: rustman contract rules [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Print a JSON array (each rule with its id, classification, description, example and the catalog version) instead of a table

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
